  ShadowColor: {x: 1.000000, y: 1.000000, z: 1.000000, w: 1.000000}
  ShadowDensity: 1.000000
  Text: |-
    Navigation Kit guides you to places with a head-locked arrow and a distance readout.
    
    Pinch a destination on the Select Location menu. A small compass near the left edge of your view points the same way.
    
    Start Position is where you stand, so pinching it shows the arrival check mark right away.
